1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:06,500
You read again.

2
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:12,070
My Class Monitor

3
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:19,770
Van was elected class monitor.

4
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:28,800
Recess, our boys talked with each other:

5
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:37,650
What kind of monitor is so skinny and short! - Lam said.

6
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:42,300
A monitor must be quick.

7
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:51,570
Van never says a word! – Quoc added.

8
00:00:51,750 --> 00:01:02,400
We all think only boys make good monitors!

9
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:14,400
This morning, during lineup, Quoc just ran to class:

10
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:23,550
Oh no! I woke up late, forgot the logbook.

11
00:01:24,220 --> 00:01:30,570
Running into class, Quoc was surprised to see the classroom clean.

12
00:01:30,570 --> 00:01:39,500
It turned out Van had done the duty for him.

13
00:01:40,150 --> 00:01:50,550
In the afternoon, the class went to weed the school garden.

14
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:56,750
Hot weather, everyone was tired and thirsty.

15
00:01:56,750 --> 00:02:03,120
Suddenly Lam shouted:

16
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:10,070
Ice cream! Ice cream! Everyone!

17
00:02:10,070 --> 00:02:17,220
The boys gathered around the ice cream cart.

18
00:02:18,070 --> 00:02:29,470
Van, sweating, quickly distributed ice cream to everyone.

19
00:02:29,870 --> 00:02:35,420
The monitor is so thoughtful!

20
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:41,350
Ah, where did you get the ice cream?

21
00:02:41,350 --> 00:02:50,720
Quoc ate and praised Van.

22
00:02:51,970 --> 00:02:57,350
The ice cream lady lent us the cart.

23
00:02:57,350 --> 00:03:05,570
And the money is from the Youth Union summer labor...

24
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:13,370
Now, if anyone asks about my class monitor,

25
00:03:13,370 --> 00:03:17,200
Now, if anyone asks about my class monitor, we will proudly say:

26
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:25,320
My class monitor is great!

